{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Attention: This is only a demo version of our official game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The full version of the game has four chapters, but the demo version <strong><u>only contains the prologue and the 30% of the second chapter.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. The demo version <strong><u>only supports Simplified and Traditional Chinese</u></strong> and <strong><u>does not support English</u></strong> or other languages. The full version will include English and other languages.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the prologue, you can enjoy a fun treasure hunt and learn about the poignant legend of the Temple of Kongfuzi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-6.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-5.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-4.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will learn how to use the notebooks to unlock the Temple of Kongfuzi's secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-2.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will explore every area that makes the\u00a0jade scroll hums and find every buried fragment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full Version Game Description\uff1a</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ode to Snow is a puzzle game with a Chinese fantasy theme. Players take on the role of Zhu You, a schoolgirl who must travel through the Temple of KongFuZi to save her friends in the mysterious Elf world and uncover its secrets, which span thousands of years.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a distinctive art style, combining pixel art with traditional Chinese painting to provide players with a unique visual experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-1.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-3.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the connection between the Temple of KongFuZi in the real world and inner world? What kind of past is recorded in the white jade scroll? What secrets does your best friend hold? It's not just answers that can anwser the questions, but also love.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788970?t=1749814024","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/03550b185d0a1033fa8def0a04ff8d7c1443b24c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749814024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/fd407dc451e6524d1ac9c0fad09a31c9e63db140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749814024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/fd407dc451e6524d1ac9c0fad09a31c9e63db140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749814024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Attention: This is only a demo version of our official game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The full version of the game has four chapters, but the demo version <strong><u>only contains the prologue and the 30% of the second chapter.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. The demo version <strong><u>only supports Simplified and Traditional Chinese</u></strong> and <strong><u>does not support English</u></strong> or other languages. The full version will include English and other languages.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the prologue, you can enjoy a fun treasure hunt and learn about the poignant legend of the Temple of Kongfuzi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-6.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-5.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-4.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will learn how to use the notebooks to unlock the Temple of Kongfuzi's secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-2.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will explore every area that makes the\u00a0jade scroll hums and find every buried fragment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Full Version Game Description\uff1a</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ode to Snow is a puzzle game with a Chinese fantasy theme. Players take on the role of Zhu You, a schoolgirl who must travel through the Temple of KongFuZi to save her friends in the mysterious Elf world and uncover its secrets, which span thousands of years.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a distinctive art style, combining pixel art with traditional Chinese painting to provide players with a unique visual experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-1.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must solve puzzles, explore game mechanisms and collect broken pieces of a bronze mirror to find their way back to the real world. The clues to solving the puzzles reveal the love-hate relationship between two elves, and as you escape from the inner world, the past gradually comes to light.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788970/extras/1-3.gif?t=1749814024\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the connection between the Temple of KongFuZi in the real world and inner world? What kind of past is recorded in the white jade scroll? What secrets does your best friend hold? It's not just answers that can anwser the questions, but also love.</p>","developers":["\u706f\u82af\u7cd5\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3478110","name":"\u6587\u5e99\u6ee1\u5ead\u96ea"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam